-- c001-v001: Paulos prerit Khristos–ke Yeshu–ke ke-dwara ichchha Parameshwar–ki aur Timotheos –ho bhai
-- c001-v002: –ko mein Kolossai pavitron aur vishwasi bhaiyon–ko mein Khristos: anugrah tumhein aur shanti se Parameshwar Pita hamare
-- c001-v003: Hum-dhanyavad-dete-hain –ko Parameshwar Pita –ke Prabhu hamare Yeshu Khristos sada ke-liye tumhare prarthna-karte-hue
-- c001-v004: sunkar –ko vishwas tumhara mein Khristos Yeshu aur –ko prem jo tum-rakhte-ho mein sab –ko pavitron
-- c001-v005: ke-dwara –ko asha –ko rakhi-hui tumhare-liye mein –mein svargon jo tum-ne-pahle-suna mein –ke vachan –ke satya –ke susmachar
-- c001-v006: –ke upasthit mein tumhare-pas jaisa bhi mein sab –mein sansar hai phal-deta-hua aur badhta-hua jaisa bhi mein tum-mein se jis din tum-ne-suna aur tum-ne-jana –ko anugrah –ka Parameshwar mein satya
-- c001-v007: jaisa tum-ne-sikha se Epaphras –ke priye saha-das hamare jo hai vishwasyogya ke-liye tumhare sevak –ka Khristos
-- c001-v008: –ne bhi prakaT-kiya hamein –ko tumhara prem mein Atma
-- c001-v009: Is-liye is bhi hum se jis din hum-ne-suna nahin hum-rukte-hain ke-liye tumhare prarthna-karte-hue aur maangne ki tum-purn-ho-jao –ko gyaan –ke ichchha uski mein sab buddhi aur samajh atmik
-- c001-v010: chalne yogya –ke Prabhu mein sab prasannta mein sab kaam achhe phal-laate-hue aur badhte-hue –mein gyaan –ke Parameshwar
-- c001-v011: mein sab shakti balvaan-kiye-jate-hue ke-anusaar –ki pratap –ke mahima uski mein sab dhairya aur sahansheelta ke-sath anand
-- c001-v012: dhanyavad-dete-hue –ko Pita –ne yogya-banaya tumhein mein –ke bhaag –ke virasat –ke pavitron mein –mein jyoti
-- c001-v013: jis-ne chhuDaya hamein se –ke adhikaar –ke andhkaar aur sthaanantarit-kiya mein –ke rajya –ke Putra –ke prem uske
-- c001-v014: mein jis-mein hum-rakhte-hain –ko chhuTkara –ko kshama –ke paapon
-- c001-v015: jo hai pratima –ke Parameshwar –ke adrishya pehlauta sab srishTi
-- c001-v016: kyonki mein us-mein rachit-huaa –ho sab mein –mein svargon aur par –ke prithvi –ho drishya aur –ho adrishya chahe sinhaasan chahe prabhutvon chahe shaasakon chahe adhikaariyon –ho sab ke-dwara uske aur ke-liye uske rachit-hua
-- c001-v017: aur vahi hai se-pahle sab aur –ho sab mein us-mein sthir-hai
-- c001-v018: aur vahi hai –ho sir –ka shareer –ke kalisia jo hai –ho aarambh pehlauta se –mein-se mriton ki ho-jaye mein sab-mein vahi pehla
-- c001-v019: kyonki mein us-mein prasanna-hua sab –ho purnta rahne
-- c001-v020: aur ke-dwara uske mila-lene –ko sab ke-liye uske shanti-karke ke-dwara –ke lahoo –ke krus uske ke-dwara uske chahe –ko par –ke prithvi chahe –ko mein –mein svargon
-- c001-v021: aur tumhein kabhi hote-hue alag-kiye-hue aur shatruon –mein samajh mein –mein kaaryon –mein bure
-- c001-v022: ab par us-ne-mila-liya mein –ke shareer –ke maans uske ke-dwara –ke mrityu prastut-karne tumhein pavitra aur nirdosh aur nirdosh saamne uske
-- c001-v023: yadi toh tum-bane-raho –mein vishwas neenv-Daale-hue aur sthir aur na haTte-hue se –ke asha –ke susmachar jo tum-ne-suna –ke prachaarit mein sab srishTi –mein ke-neeche –ke svarg jiska main-ban-gaya main Paulos sevak
-- c001-v024: Ab main-anand-karta-hoon mein –mein dukh ke-liye tumhare aur main-poora-karta-hoon –ko kami –ke kleshon –ke Khristos mein –mein maans mere ke-liye –ke shareer uske jo hai –ho kalisia
-- c001-v025: jiske main-ban-gaya main sevak ke-anusaar –ko prabandh –ke Parameshwar –ko diya-gaya mujhe ke-liye tumhare poora-karne –ko vachan –ka Parameshwar
-- c001-v026: –ko rahasya –ko chhipa-hua se –mein-se yugon aur se –mein-se peedhiyon ab par prakaT-hua –ko pavitron uske
-- c001-v027: jinko chaaha –ne Parameshwar jatana kya –ho dhanvanta –ke mahima –ke rahasya is mein –mein jatiyon jo hai Khristos mein tum-mein –ho asha –ke mahima
-- c001-v028: jise hum ghoshit-karte-hain chetaavni-dete-hue har manushya aur sikhate-hue har manushya mein sab buddhi ki hum-prastut-karen har manushya purn mein Khristos
-- c001-v029: ke-liye jis bhi main-parishram-karta-hoon sangharsh-karta-hua ke-anusaar –ke shakti uski –ko kaarya-karti-hui mein mujh-mein mein shakti
