-- c002-v002: ki dilasa-payen –ho dilon unke judh-kar mein prem aur mein sab dhanvanta –ke purn-nishchaya –ke samajh mein gyaan –ke rahasya –ke Parameshwar Khristos
-- c002-v003: mein jis-mein hain sab –ho khazaane –ke buddhi aur gyaan chhipe
-- c002-v004: Yeh main-kahta-hoon ki koi-na tumhein bhatkaaye mein lubhaavni-baaton-se
-- c002-v005: yadi kyonki bhi –mein shareer main-door-hoon parantu –mein atma ke-sath tumhare main-hoon anand-karta-hua aur dekhta-hua tumhari –ko vyavastha aur –ko dridhta –ke mein Khristos vishwas tumhare
-- c002-v006: Jaisa isliye tum-ne-grahan-kiya –ko Khristos Yeshu –ko Prabhu mein us-mein chalo
-- c002-v007: jadh-kiye-hue aur banaaye-jaate-hue mein us-mein aur sthir-kiye-jaate-hue –mein vishwas jaisa tum-ne-sikha badhte-hue mein us-mein mein dhanyavaad
-- c002-v008: Dekho na koi tumhein ho –ho bandh-banaata ke-dwara –ke darshan-shaastra aur khokhe dhokhe ke-anusaar –ke parampara –ke manushyon ke-anusaar –ko tatvon –ke sansar aur nahin ke-anusaar Khristos
-- c002-v009: kyonki mein us-mein rahti-hai sab –ho purnta –ke devtva shaareerik-roop-se
