-- c002-v011: mein jis-mein bhi tum-khatna-kiye-gaye khatna haathon-se-na-bani mein –ke utaarne –ke shareer –ke maans mein –ke khatna –ke Khristos
-- c002-v012: gaaDhe-gaye uske-sath mein –mein baptisma mein jis-mein bhi tum-uthaaye-gaye ke-dwara –ke vishwas –ke shakti –ke Parameshwar –ne uthaya use se mriton
-- c002-v013: aur tumhein mrit hote-hue mein –mein apradhon aur –mein akhatnepan –ke maans tumhare jeevan-diya tumhein ke-sath uske kshama-karke hamein sab –ko apradhon
-- c002-v014: miTakar –ko ke-viruddh hamare hastlekh –mein niyamon jo tha virodhi hamare aur use haTA-diya se –ke beech Thok-kar use –mein krus
-- c002-v015: utaar-kar –ko shaasakon aur –ko adhikaariyon dikhaaya mein khule-aam vijay-pradarshan-karke unhe mein us-mein
-- c002-v016: Na isliye koi tumhein nyaay-kare mein khane aur mein peene ya mein bhaag tyohaar ya naye-chaand ya sabbaton
-- c002-v017: jo hain chhaya –ke aane-walon –ho par shareer –ka Khristos
-- c002-v018: koi-na tumhein vyarth-Thahraaye chaahta-hua mein dikhawaTi-namrata aur upasana –ke swargduton jo usne-dekha pravisht-hota-hua vyarth phoolaa-hua ke-dwara –ke mann –ke maans uske
-- c002-v019: aur nahin pakdhe-hue –ko Sir se jis-se sab –ho shareer ke-dwara –ke jodhon aur bandhon diya-jaata-hua aur judhta-hua badhta-hai –ko vriddhi –ke Parameshwar
-- c002-v020: Yadi tum-mar-gaye ke-sath Khristos se –ke tatvon –ke sansar kyon jaisa jeete-hue mein sansar tum-adheesh-rakhte-ho
-- c002-v021: Na chhuyo na chakho na sparsh-karo
