-- c002-v023: jo-kuchh hai vachan toh rakhte-hue buddhi mein man-gadhant-dharma aur dikhawaTi-namrata aur kaThinta shareer nahin mein maan kisi ke-liye tripti –ke maans
-- c003-v001: Yadi isliye tum-uthaaye-gaye –ke-sath Khristos –ko uupar dhundho jahaan –ho Khristos hai mein dahiney –ke Parameshwar baithaa-hua
-- c003-v002: –ko uupar socho na –ko par –ke prithvi
-- c003-v003: tum-mar-gaye kyonki aur –ho jeevan tumhara chhipa-hai ke-sath –ke Khristos mein –mein Parameshwar
-- c003-v004: jab –ho Khristos prakaT-ho –ho jeevan tumhara tab bhi tum ke-sath uske prakaT-ho-jaoge mein mahima
-- c003-v005: Maar-Daalo isliye –ko angon –ko par –ke prithvi vyabhichaar ashuddhta vaasna buri-ichchha buri aur –ko lobh jo hai murtipuja
-- c003-v006: ke-kaaran jinke aata-hai –ho krodh –ka Parameshwar par –ko putron –ke avagya
-- c003-v007: mein jinmein bhi tum tum-chale kabhi jab tum-jeete-the mein inmein
-- c003-v008: ab par tum-utaar-do bhi tum –ko sab krodh gussa buraai ninda gandi-baat se –ke munh tumhare
-- c003-v009: na jhooth-bolo mein aapas utaar-kar –ko puraane manushya ke-sath –ke kaaryon uske
-- c003-v010: aur pahan-kar –ko naye –ko naya-kiye-jaate-hue mein gyaan ke-anusaar pratima –ke rachne-waale use
-- c003-v011: jahaan nahin hai Yunani aur Yahudi khatna aur akhatnepan barbar Skuthai das swatantra parantu –ho sab aur mein sab-mein Khristos
-- c003-v012: Pahano isliye jaisa chune-hue –ke Parameshwar pavitra aur priye daya karuna bhalai namrata narmta sahansheelta
-- c003-v013: sahte-hue ek-dusre aur kshama-karte-hue aap-ko yadi koi ke-prati kisi rakhta-ho shikayat jaisa bhi –ne Prabhu kshama-kiya tumhein vaise bhi tum
-- c003-v014: par sab-par par in –ko prem jo hai bandhan –ke purnta
-- c003-v015: aur –ho shanti –ke Khristos raaj-kare mein –mein dilon tumhare ke-liye jis bhi tum-bulaaye-gaye mein ek shareer aur dhanyavaadi bano
-- c003-v016: –ho vachan –ka Khristos rahe mein tum-mein bharpuree-se mein sab buddhi sikhate-hue aur chetaavni-dete-hue apne-aap-ko bhajnon stutiyiyon geeton atmik mein –ke anugrah gaate-hue mein –mein dilon tumhare –ko Parameshwar
-- c003-v017: aur sab jo kuchh bhi tum-karo mein vachan ya mein kaam sab mein naam Prabhu Yeshu dhanyavad-dete-hue –ko Parameshwar Pita ke-dwara uske
-- c003-v018: –Ho patniyaan adheenta-mein-raho –ke patiyon jaisa uchit-hai mein Prabhu
-- c003-v019: –Ho pati prem-karo –se patniyon aur na kadhwa-bano ke-prati un
-- c003-v020: –Ho bacche aagya-mano –ki maata-pita ke-anusaar sab yeh kyonki bhata hai mein Prabhu
-- c003-v021: –Ho pitaon na chidhaao –ko bachon tumhare ki na ve-niraash-hon
-- c003-v022: –Ho dason aagya-maano ke-anusaar sab –ke ke-anusaar maans malikon na mein dikhawaTi-seva jaisa manushyon-ko-prasanna-karne-waale parantu mein saralata dil Darte-hue –se Prabhu
-- c003-v023: jo bhi tum-karo se praan kaam-karo jaisa –ke-liye Prabhu aur nahin manushyon
-- c003-v024: jaante-hue ki se Prabhu tum-paoge –ko badla –ke virasat –ke Prabhu Khristos seva-karo
-- c003-v025: –ho kyonki anyay-karne-waala paayega jo usne-anyay-kiya aur nahin hai pakshpaat
-- c004-v001: –Ho malikon –ko nyaay aur –ko baraabri –ke dason do jaante-hue ki bhi tum rakhte-ho Prabhu mein svarg
-- c004-v002: –Mein prarthna lage-raho jagte-hue mein us-mein mein dhanyavaad
-- c004-v003: prarthna-karte-hue sath bhi ke-liye hamare ki –ho Parameshwar khole hamein dwar –ka vachan bolne –ko rahasya –ka Khristos ke-liye jis bhi main-bandha-hoon
-- c004-v004: ki main-prakaT-karoon use jaisa chahiye mujhe bolna
-- c004-v005: Mein buddhi chalo ke-prati –ko baaharwalon –ko samay mol-lete-hue
-- c004-v006: –ho vachan tumhara sada mein anugrah namak-se swadisht jaanna kaise chahiye tumhein ek har-ek uttar-dena
-- c004-v007: –Ko ke-vishay mere sab jatayega tumhein Tuchikos –ho priya bhai aur vishwasyogya sevak aur saha-das mein Prabhu
-- c004-v008: jise maine-bheja ke-pas tumhare ke-liye isi is ki tum-jaano –ko ke-vishay hamare aur voh-dilasa-de –ko dilon tumhare
-- c004-v009: ke-sath Onesimos –ke vishwasyogya aur priye bhai jo hai se tumhare sab tumhein ve-jatayenge –ko yahaan
-- c004-v010: Abhivaadan-karta-hai tumhein Aristarkhos –ho saha-bandi mera aur Markos –ho bhanja Barnaba ke-baare-mein jis tum-ne-paya aadesh yadi voh-aaye ke-pas tumhare swikaaro use
-- c004-v011: aur Yeshu –ho kehlaata Yustos –ho hote-hue se khatna ye akele saha-karmi ke-liye –ke rajya –ke Parameshwar jo ban-gaye mere-liye shanti
-- c004-v012: abhivaadan-karta-hai tumhein Epaphras –ho se tumhare das Khristos Yeshu sada sangharsh-karta-hua ke-liye tumhare mein –mein prarthnaon ki tum-khade-raho purn aur purn-nishchit mein sab ichchha –ke Parameshwar
-- c004-v013: main-gawahi-deta-hoon kyonki uski ki voh-rakhta-hai bahut parishram ke-liye tumhare aur –ke mein Laodikeia aur –ke mein Hiera– polis
-- c004-v014: abhivaadan-karta-hai tumhein Loukas –ho vaidya –ho priya aur Demas
-- c004-v015: Abhivaadan-karo –ko mein Laodikeia bhaiyon aur Numpha aur –ko ke-anusaar ghar uske kalisia
-- c004-v016: aur jab padha-jaye ke-pas tumhare –ho patra karo ki bhi mein –mein Laodikeiyon kalisia padha-jaye aur –ko se Laodikeia ki bhi tum padho
-- c004-v017: aur kaho Arkhippos Dekh –ko seva jo tune-paya mein Prabhu ki use tu-poora-kar
-- c004-v018: –Ho abhivaadan –ke mere haath Paulos yaad-rakho mere –ko bandhon –ho anugrah ke-sath tumhare Amen

